cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pre-registration or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Silicyte Ratchet (silicyte-0119): a pre-registered, compute-matched test of whether a verified-helper library compounds on ARC-AGI-1"
abstract: >-
  Pre-registration and harness for a compute-matched test on 400 sealed ARC-AGI-1 evaluation tasks.
  A growing library of verified Python helpers (STOCK) is compared at equal total tokens with the same
  library frozen after round 1 (STATIC), the same tokens in one round (ONE-SHOT), verified exemplars
  (EXEMPLAR), a matched sham library (SHAM) and extra sampling with no library (FLAT-TTC), with two
  planted positive controls (PLANT-DRIP, PLANT-L1). Registered 2026-11-04 at commit cc5fb5b. Result pending.
